{
  "name": "AI Agent Safety Guard — Idempotency, Budget Caps & Kill Switch",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛡️ AI AGENT SAFETY GUARD\n**What it does:** A guard sub-workflow other workflows/agents call BEFORE any outbound action (send email/message, create a charge, booking or ticket). It runs 4 checks — idempotency, monthly budget, hourly rate cap, kill switch — then an AI risk review. Only allowed actions execute. Every decision is logged to a Google Sheets guard ledger and Telegram gets a summary.\n\n**You'll need:**\n- OpenAI API key (platform.openai.com)\n- Google Sheets OAuth2 credentials\n- Telegram bot token + your chat ID (@BotFather → /newbot)\n- A target endpoint URL that performs the action (your own API / Zapier webhook / another n8n workflow)\n\n**Status flow in Sheets:** `NEW` → `PROCESSING` → `DONE` / `BLOCKED_DUPLICATE` / `BLOCKED_BUDGET` / `BLOCKED_RATE` / `BLOCKED_KILLSWITCH` / `BLOCKED_AGENT` / `FAILED`\n\n**Call it like this (POST JSON):** `{ \"client_id\": \"acme\", \"action_type\": \"send_email\", \"recipient\": \"customer@example.com\", \"payload\": { \"subject\": \"...\", \"body\": \"...\" }, \"estimated_tokens\": 1200 }`",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 4080,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "91ea42ef-3473-454a-94eb-2c06af558cdc",
      "name": "STICKY — Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
